    <string name="setup_open_settings">Choose Shoten as digital assistant</string>
    <string name="setup_how_title">How to open it</string>
    <string name="setup_how">• Hold the navigation handle or the home button. On Pixel phones, first turn off “Hold handle for Circle to Search” (or “Hold Home for Circle to Search”) in Settings › System › Navigation mode.\n• Or swipe up diagonally from a bottom corner, or hold the power button if it is set to open the digital assistant.\n• In the assistant settings, keep “Use text from screen” and “Use screenshot” on — Shoten needs the screenshot to read the text.\n• You can also select text in any app and choose “Look up in Shoten”, or share a screenshot to Shoten.</string>
